                <pb facs="1125" n="1045" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1045"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Leishman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>(Mr. Adee suggests that, the Sultan having arranged for Mr. Leishman to meet the
                    grand vizier, it may be best to see him and strongly insist upon adherence to
                    agreements between Mr. Leishman and the minister for foreign affairs.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
